            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 180,
            "title": "Live Better Longer",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>By neutralizing harmful free radicals and oxidative stress, which is the leading cause of disease, hydrogen water has been proven to help regulate heart disease, diabetes, reduce wrinkles and skin issues, and speed up wound healing.</p>",
            "align_text": "center",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20868296540481__f2691f6f-1940-49ed-8648-06c95ed90d7b-text_block-2": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/GO_Boosts-Cognitive-Performance.webp",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 180,
            "title": "Brain Health",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>As a selective antioxidant, hydrogen water has been proven to improve mental clarity, prevent cognitive illness, reduce oxidative stress and inflammation, boost mental focus and clarity, and help with mental illnesses.</p>",
            "align_text": "center",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20868296540481__f2691f6f-1940-49ed-8648-06c95ed90d7b-text_block-3": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/GO_Improves-Gut-Function_db9c93f4-ad42-46a3-8e8c-efbe30912df2.webp",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 180,
            "title": "Increase Immune Function",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>70% to 80% of the immune system is housed in your gut. Stress, poor diet, and pesticides weaken your gut to nearly 20% functionality. The electrical potential in Echo H2 Water™ repairs and restores the gut and improves food intolerances.</p>",
            "align_text": "center",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "6b50826d-ffac-4a97-af10-6dbdc0d19aa7": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "enable_image": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/GO_Reduces-Inflammation-and-Oxidative-Stress.webp",
            "image_mask": "none",
            "image_width": 180,
            "title": "Improved Energy",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Adequate hydrogen supply is essential for optimal energy production in the body, which can help improve energy levels and combat fatigue.</p>",
            "align_text": "center",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
