    "af69bca5-8e70-4543-add7-1d58f267111b": {
      "type": "icon-list-and-image",
      "blocks": {
        "template--20868296540481__af69bca5-8e70-4543-add7-1d58f267111b-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Product Features",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "template--20868296540481__af69bca5-8e70-4543-add7-1d58f267111b-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>Designed for people on the go, the Echo Go+™ hydrogen water bottle allows you to have access to hydrogen-enriched water whether you are working out at the gym, running errands, taking a vacation, or simply enjoying the outdoors.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--20868296540481__af69bca5-8e70-4543-add7-1d58f267111b-sales_point-1": {
          "type": "sales_point",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "ribbon",
            "icon_color": "",
            "text": "<strong>State-of-the-Art Technology. </strong>As one of the best portable hydrogen water generators in the industry, the Echo Go+™ uses safe, high-quality, platinum-coated titanium electrode plates to produce hydrogen-enriched water. The Echo Go+™ uses state-of-the-art Solid Polymer Electrolysis (SPE) and Proton Exchange Membrane (PEM) technologies. As a result, the Echo Go+™ produces above the therapeutic level of 0.5 ppm of molecular hydrogen, providing 2-3 ppm of molecular hydrogen in a 5-minute cycle and up to 4.5 ppm in a 10-minute cycle. It also produces an oxidation-reduction potential (ORP) of -600mV or more."
          }
        },
        "e6f8de0a-3187-4e7c-939d-4cfef18cbdb8": {
          "type": "sales_point",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "leaf",
            "icon_color": "",
            "text": "<strong>Safe for You and the Planet. </strong>The Echo Go+™ is made out food food-grade polycarbonate plastic, a truly BPA- and all-bisphenol-free product. It is also much lighter than glass and impact-resistant, making it easier for you to handle without the fear of breaking or cracking. PC plastic is a very tough material, which allows your Echo Go+™ to last longer while also helping you reduce long-term waste from traditional disposable water bottles. This plastic is environmentally friendly."
          }
        }
      },
